sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Researcher
    participant GUI as Web GUI
    participant API as eLabFTW API
    participant Fleet as Monad Fleet service
    participant Device

    Researcher->>GUI: Create or update experiment
    GUI->>API: POST/PATCH /experiments/{id}
    GUI->>API: PATCH /experiments/{id} metadata.policy (JSON editor)
    GUI->>API: POST /experiments/{id}/tags (fleet, device:...)
    API-->>GUI: 200/201 OK

    Device->>Fleet: GetPolicy(device_id, last_policy_revision)
    Fleet->>API: GET /items?search=device_id
    API-->>Fleet: resource metadata + tags
    Fleet->>API: GET /experiments?tags[]=fleet
    API-->>Fleet: candidate experiments

    Note over Fleet: Select best matching experiment\n(latest + selector match)

    Fleet->>API: GET /experiments/{selected_id}
    API-->>Fleet: tags + metadata (includes policy)
    Fleet->>API: GET /experiments/{selected_id} (read metadata policy)
    API-->>Fleet: policy JSON
    Fleet-->>Device: PolicyResponse(policy_revision, policy_json)

    alt Revision unchanged
        Fleet-->>Device: not_modified=true
    end
